+## Overview
+
+Total revenue was $7,154.44 across 30 orders placed between May 2 and May 21, 2026. The median order value was $204.95. Orders span four regions and four products.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads with $2,392.00 in revenue from just 16 units, driven by its $149.50 price. Widget follows at $2,118.94 from 106 units. Doohickey brought in $1,513.00 and Sprocket $1,130.50.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North leads all regions with $2,176.35, followed by East at $1,830.79 and South at $1,732.48. West trails at $1,414.82, the weakest of the four.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Promote Gadget harder; it earns the most revenue from the fewest units sold.
+- Investigate West's weak sales and test targeted promotions to close the regional gap.
+- Keep Widget inventory high since it sells the most units at steady mid-range prices.
